      "name": "Zero-Footprint Installer and NPX Zero-Clone Package (v1.1.0)",
      "description": "Eliminate installation clutter from the user's project for Codex CLI, Antigravity CLI and OpenCode: the git-clone one-liner removes its own clone after installing, uninstall works without the clone, and a new npx/uvx wrapper installs from a release bundle downloaded to the OS temp directory, so no repository is ever left in the project.",
