    {
      "@type": "Action",
      "@id": "urn:voltron:mission:zero-footprint-installer-npx-zero-clone-v1-1-0:assignment:5",
      "name": "Live smoke runs on Codex, Antigravity and OpenCode",
      "description": "In three fresh scratch projects (one per CLI), install through (a) the git-clone one-liner with --cleanup and (b) the packed npx wrapper with ACTIONBOARD_BUNDLE set to a local tarball, since the v1.1.0 tag does not exist yet. After each install, list the project tree and confirm only the CLI's own directories were added, then run one short mission prompt in each CLI's non-interactive mode to prove the formation still loads and the guard and Context7 still work. Uninstall with the standalone uninstaller and confirm the project returns to its pre-install file list. Record results; do not fix defects.",
      "agent": {
        "@id": "urn:voltron:lion:yellow"
      },
      "actionStatus": "https://schema.org/CompletedActionStatus",
      "result": [
        {
          "@type": "DefinedTerm",
          "name": "acceptance",
          "description": "results-2026-10-v1.1.md has one row per CLI per install path with CLI version, the before/after directory listing, pass/fail for install, mission load, guard, Context7 and uninstall, and a transcript excerpt for every failure."
        },
        {
          "@type": "DefinedTerm",
          "name": "outcome",
          "description": "tests/smoke/results-2026-10-v1.1.md: six rows (three CLIs by one-liner and npx). Install, no-leftover, mission load and Context7 pass everywhere; guard passes (Codex via rules layer only, D2). Uninstall failed on four rows (D1); after Red's fix all four were retested and pass. D3 to D5 recorded."
        }
      ],
      "object": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:voltron:file:tests/smoke/results-2026-10-v1.1.md"
        }
      ],
      "additionalProperty": [
