    {
      "@type": "Action",
      "@id": "urn:voltron:mission:zero-footprint-installer-npx-zero-clone-v1-1-0:assignment:6",
      "name": "Release documentation and version bump",
      "description": "Make the npx command the default install path for Codex, Antigravity and OpenCode in the README Quick Start and per-CLI guides, with the uvx command and the git-clone one-liner (now with --cleanup) as fallbacks; replace the .gitignore/.graphifyignore pro-tip with the zero-footprint explanation and document the standalone uninstaller; keep the manual clone path documented for users who keep a checkout for updates. Write the 1.1.0 CHANGELOG entry. Bump src/VERSION to 1.1.0 as the last step and regenerate dist/ and the marketplace so every plugin.json reads 1.1.0.",
      "agent": {
        "@id": "urn:voltron:lion:red"
      },
      "actionStatus": "https://schema.org/CompletedActionStatus",
      "result": [
        {
          "@type": "DefinedTerm",
          "name": "acceptance",
          "description": "`python scripts/build.py --check` prints 'dist/ is up to date'; every plugin.json and packages/installer/package.json read 1.1.0; the README Quick Start shows an npx command for each of the three CLIs and still shows the manual clone path; CHANGELOG has a dated 1.1.0 section; every failing smoke row links a fix or a stated reason."
        },
        {
          "@type": "DefinedTerm",
          "name": "outcome",
